# Data layers

## Composables (`composables/`)

Orchestration UI: submit, loading, navigation, guards. Gọi store/service — **không** `$apiFetch` trực tiếp.

```ts
// ✅ composables/customer/useCustomerList.ts
const { $apiFetch } = useNuxtApp()
const service = createCustomerService($apiFetch)
```

## Services (`services/`)

HTTP only. Factory `createXxxService(api)`. Parse response qua `parseApiData` / `parseSchemaOrThrow`.

## Stores (`stores/`)

Client state (token, list cache, toast, dialog). Gọi service — không embed endpoint strings.

## Models vs Validations

| | `models/` | `validations/` |
|--|-----------|----------------|
| Mục đích | API contract Zod | Form rules vee-validate |
| Độ chặt | Lỏng (`password: string`) | Chặt (min 8, email…) |

## Form base

```ts
useApiForm<T>({ validationSchema, initialValues, submit })
```
